WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.694
The Local Group.

00:02.394 --> 00:13.339
Our galaxy and Andromeda, 2.5 million light-years apart, are the two large members of a group of more than a hundred galaxies, most of them small.

00:13.789 --> 00:18.649
Gravity holds this group together while the universe around it expands.
